  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I had an idea, not sure if it would be possible....if so that would be amazing, since I reported a guy who was pretending to me, in the future will it be possible to remove custom fonts/emojis from the game all together????\nthe imposter who went around as me, has like a few pixels differences from the default in game font so they can't get searched when you type the name, in my eyes that's a huge issue and can abused\nso my opinion only the default text should be allowed in game and none of this jumbled random font bs, content creators as myself can be falsely reported\nthank you and have a good day",
